 3. Other happenings 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Photo: Smith Collection/Gado/Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 👖 Gap announced a new CEO for Old Navy as the brand reported a drop in comparable sales. ( CNBC )

 ⛳️ Golf equipment maker Callaway cut ties with Good Good after the YouTube brand made a controversial ad in which a golfer shoves a woman to the ground. ( CNN )

 ⚽️ Joshua Kushner and his firm Thrive Capital are being pulled into the feud between soccer's two biggest governing bodies, as UEFA seeks documents from them for a possible criminal case against FIFA president Gianni Infantino over his failed plan to sell investors a stake in FIFA's commercial business. ( WSJ )

 
 
